{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24646","headline":"游丰乐招提佛光三寺 · 白居易","name":"游丰乐招提佛光三寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹鞋葵扇白绡巾，林野爲家云是身。\n山寺每游多寄宿，都城暂出即经旬。\n汉容黄绮爲逋客，尧放巢由作外臣。\n昨日制书临郡县，不该愚谷醉乡人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}